            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint allows the initiator to change an existing fraud record using minimal input parameters for Mastercard built transactions. The initiator can modify both successful and rejected fraud transactions and also modify transactions which are submitted via other channels such as GFT, file upload, and online.",
